    "Use original rectangle A=(0,5),B=(50,5),C=(50,0),D=(0,0); M=(25,0),N=(25,5). The folds are reflections, so the B-to-M crease is the perpendicular bisector5x+y=190 and the D-to-N crease is5x+y=65.",
